                    182.0,
                    678.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5. A non-probationary career employee who refuses an offered position at the same base rate of pay shall be placed in layoff status. Probationary, limited, or per diem employees who refuse an offered position at the same base rate of pay shall be released.",
            "block_bbox": [
                182,
